function hrMaskIbanV76(v){const s=String(v||'').replace(/\s/g,'');if(!s)return '—';return `${s.slice(0,4)} •••• •••• •••• ••${s.slice(-4)}`;}
function hrWpsWorkspaceV76(){const runs=[...hrV72.payrollRuns].sort((a,b)=>String(b.period_start).localeCompare(String(a.period_start)));return `<div class="hr76-disclaimer"><b>${hrL72('حماية الأجور — تجهيز ومطابقة فقط','Wage Protection — preparation & reconciliation only')}</b> · ${hrL72('تاسكي يتحقق من جاهزية المسير والحسابات البنكية ويصدر ورقة CSV داخلية للمطابقة. هذا الملف ليس صيغة البنك/مدد الرسمية، والرفع الرسمي يتم خارج تاسكي عبر قناة حماية الأجور المعتمدة.','Tasky checks payroll/bank readiness and exports an internal reconciliation CSV. It is not the official bank/Mudad file; official submission remains outside Tasky through the approved Wage Protection channel.')}</div><div class="hr72-panel"><div class="hr72-panel-head"><div><h3>${hrL72('جاهزية المسيرات لحماية الأجور','Payroll WPS readiness')}</h3><p>${hrL72('اعتماد المسير + رقم موظف + IBAN سعودي صالح + انتهاء مراجعة التأمينات.','Approved payroll + employee number + valid Saudi IBAN + completed GOSI review.')}</p></div></div>${runs.map(r=>hrWpsRunCardV76(r)).join('')||`<div class="hr72-empty">${hrL72('لا توجد مسيرات رواتب لفحصها.','No payroll runs to check.')}</div>`}</div><div class="hr72-panel" style="margin-top:10px"><div class="hr72-panel-head"><div><h3>${hrL72('الحسابات البنكية للموظفين','Employee bank accounts')}</h3><p>${hrL72('بيانات خاصة لا تظهر إلا للموظف نفسه وHR/Payroll.','Private data visible only to the employee and authorized HR/Payroll.')}</p></div></div><div class="hr76-bank-grid">${hrV72.employees.filter(e=>['active','probation','leave'].includes(e.status)).map(e=>{const b=hrBankV76(e.id);return `<div class="hr76-bank"><div class="hr76-bank-top"><div><h4>${escapeHtml(hrName72(e))}</h4><p>${escapeHtml(e.employee_no||hrL72('بدون رقم وظيفي','No employee number'))}</p></div>${b?.verified_at?`<span class="hr72-pill ok">${hrL72('متحقق','Verified')}</span>`:`<span class="hr72-pill warn">${hrL72('غير متحقق','Unverified')}</span>`}</div><div class="hr76-iban">${escapeHtml(hrMaskIbanV76(b?.iban))}</div><p>${escapeHtml(b?.bank_name||'—')}</p><div class="hr76-bank-actions"><button class="platform-mini-btn" onclick="hrOpenFormV72('bank76',null,'${e.id}')">${b?hrL72('تعديل','Edit'):hrL72('إضافة حساب','Add account')}</button></div></div>`}).join('')}</div></div>`;}
function hrWpsRunCardV76(r){const ready=hrWpsReadinessV76[r.id],batch=hrWpsBatchV76(r.id),items=hrRunItemsV75(r.id);const blockers=ready?.blockers||[],warnings=ready?.warnings||[];return `<div class="hr76-wps-card"><div class="hr76-wps-top"><div><h4>${escapeHtml(hrPayrollMonthLabelV75(r))} · ${hrPayrollStatusV75(r.status)} ${batch?hrWpsStatusV76(batch.status):''}</h4><p>${items.length} ${hrL72('موظف','employees')} · ${hrMoney72(hrSumV75(items,'net_pay'))} ${hrL72('صافي','net')}</p></div><div class="hr76-actions"><button class="platform-mini-btn" onclick="hrCheckWpsV76('${r.id}')">${hrL72('فحص الجاهزية','Check readiness')}</button>${ready?.ready?`<button class="platform-mini-btn primary" onclick="hrExportWpsV76('${r.id}')">${hrL72('تصدير ورقة المطابقة CSV','Export reconciliation CSV')}</button>`:''}${batch&&['exported','uploaded','accepted','exceptions'].includes(batch.status)?`<button class="platform-mini-btn" onclick="hrOpenFormV72('wpsBatch76',null,'${r.id}')">${hrL72('تحديث حالة الرفع','Update external status')}</button>`:''}</div></div>${ready?`<div class="hr76-wps-grid"><div><span>${hrL72('الحالة','Status')}</span><b style="color:${ready.ready?'var(--green)':'var(--danger)'}">${ready.ready?hrL72('جاهز','Ready'):hrL72('غير جاهز','Blocked')}</b></div><div><span>${hrL72('IBAN مفقود','Missing IBAN')}</span><b>${Number(ready.missing_bank_accounts||0)}</b></div><div><span>${hrL72('حساب غير متحقق','Unverified bank')}</span><b>${Number(ready.unverified_bank_accounts||0)}</b></div><div><span>${hrL72('رقم وظيفي مفقود','Missing employee no.')}</span><b>${Number(ready.missing_employee_numbers||0)}</b></div><div><span>${hrL72('مراجعة تأمينات','GOSI review')}</span><b>${Number(ready.gosi_review_items||0)}</b></div></div>${blockers.length||warnings.length?`<div class="hr76-issues">${blockers.length?`<div class="hr76-blockers"><b>${hrL72('عوائق','Blockers')}</b><ul>${blockers.map(x=>`<li>${escapeHtml(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul></div>`:'<div></div>'}${warnings.length?`<div class="hr76-warnings"><b>${hrL72('تنبيهات','Warnings')}</b><ul>${warnings.map(x=>`<li>${escapeHtml(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul></div>`:'<div></div>'}</div>`:''}`:''}${batch?.external_reference?`<div class="hr76-review-note">${hrL72('المرجع الخارجي','External reference')}: ${escapeHtml(batch.external_reference)}${batch.exception_note?` · ${escapeHtml(batch.exception_note)}`:''}</div>`:''}</div>`;}
async function hrCheckWpsV76(runId){try{const {data,error}=await sb.rpc('tasky_hr_wps_readiness_v76',{p_run_id:runId});if(error)throw error;hrWpsReadinessV76[runId]=data||{};await fetchHrDataV72(true);hrWpsReadinessV76[runId]=data||{};renderModule();}catch(err){showTaskyDialog({title:'WPS V76',message:err?.message||String(err),tone:'error'});}}
function hrCsvV76(v){const s=String(v??'');return `"${s.replace(/"/g,'""')}"`;}
async function hrExportWpsV76(runId){try{let ready=hrWpsReadinessV76[runId];if(!ready){const q=await sb.rpc('tasky_hr_wps_readiness_v76',{p_run_id:runId});if(q.error)throw q.error;ready=q.data;hrWpsReadinessV76[runId]=ready;}if(!ready?.ready)throw new Error(hrL72('يوجد عوائق يجب حلها قبل التصدير.','Resolve WPS blockers before export.'));const run=hrPayrollRunV75(runId),items=hrRunItemsV75(runId);const headers=['employee_no','employee_name','iban','bank_name','gross_pay','employee_gosi','other_deductions','net_pay','period_start','period_end'];const lines=[headers.map(hrCsvV76).join(',')];for(const i of items){const e=hrEmp72(i.employee_id),b=hrBankV76(i.employee_id),other=Number(i.recurring_deductions||0)+Number(i.unpaid_leave_deduction||0)+Number(i.attendance_deduction||0)+Number(i.other_deductions||0);lines.push([e?.employee_no||'',hrName72(e),String(b?.iban||'').replace(/\s/g,''),b?.bank_name||'',Number(i.gross_pay||0).toFixed(2),Number(i.gosi_employee_amount||0).toFixed(2),other.toFixed(2),Number(i.net_pay||0).toFixed(2),run?.period_start||'',run?.period_end||''].map(hrCsvV76).join(','));}const blob=new Blob(['\uFEFF'+lines.join('\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download=`tasky_wps_reconciliation_${String(run?.period_start||'').slice(0,7)||'payroll'}.csv`;document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);const {error}=await sb.rpc('tasky_hr_set_wps_batch_status_v76',{p_run_id:runId,p_status:'exported',p_external_reference:null,p_note:'Tasky internal reconciliation CSV exported'});if(error)throw error;await fetchHrDataV72(true);taskyToast(hrL72('تم تصدير ورقة المطابقة الداخلية','Internal reconciliation CSV exported'),{tone:'success'});}catch(err){showTaskyDialog({title:'WPS V76',message:err?.message||String(err),tone:'error'});}}

